# Render Static Site routing (Netlify-style _redirects).
#
# The site is LANDING-FIRST:
#   - "/"        → index.html  = the marketing landing page (a real file, so it
#                 wins over the redirect below)
#   - "/app.html"→ the Flutter web app shell (renamed by build.sh)
#   - every other path that isn't a real file (e.g. /loginUni, /resetPasswordUni)
#     → app.html, so the Flutter SPA router handles client-side routes.
#
# This file MUST live in the published directory (build/web/_redirects).
# build.sh copies it in after `flutter build web`.
/*    /app.html   200
